{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "17e8492b-1a53-589b-b69a-5ec7846bb152",
    "name": "Cashflow — Lançamentos e Consolidado",
    "description": "Exercita as duas APIs locais. O pre-request da coleção gera o token JWT (mesmo algoritmo de scripts/dev-jwt/make_token.py) e um X-Correlation-Id novo por requisição; cada POST define a própria Idempotency-Key. Use o environment \"cashflow local\" e rode as pastas em ordem (ou Run collection).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Token HS256 igual ao de scripts/dev-jwt/make_token.py; reaproveitado enquanto faltar mais de 60 s para expirar.",
          "const now = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);",
          "let token = pm.collectionVariables.get('accessToken');",
          "const tokenExp = parseInt(pm.collectionVariables.get('accessTokenExp') || '0', 10);",
          "",
          "if (!token || tokenExp - now <= 60) {",
          "    const CryptoJS = require('crypto-js');",
          "    const base64url = (words) => CryptoJS.enc.Base64.stringify(words)",
          "        .replace(/=+$/, '').replace(/\\+/g, '-').replace(/\\//g, '_');",
          "    const encodeJson = (obj) => base64url(CryptoJS.enc.Utf8.parse(JSON.stringify(obj)));",
          "",
          "    const header = { alg: 'HS256', typ: 'JWT' };",
          "    const payload = {",
          "        iss: pm.environment.get('jwtIssuer'),",
          "        aud: pm.environment.get('jwtAudience'),",
          "        sub: pm.environment.get('jwtSubject'),",
          "        iat: now,",
          "        nbf: now,",
          "        exp: now + 3600,",
          "        scope: pm.environment.get('jwtScopes')",
          "    };",
          "    const signingInput = encodeJson(header) + '.' + encodeJson(payload);",
          "    const signature = base64url(CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(signingInput, pm.environment.get('jwtSigningKey')));",
          "",
          "    token = signingInput + '.' + signature;",
          "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', token);",
          "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessTokenExp', String(payload.exp));",
          "}",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Authorization', value: 'Bearer ' + token });",
          "",
          "// Um X-Correlation-Id novo por requisição; o último fica em correlationId para buscar nos logs.",
          "const correlationId = 'postman-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}');",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('correlationId', correlationId);",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Correlation-Id', value: correlationId });"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Lançamentos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar lançamento (201)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Chave nova a cada execução; as duas requisições seguintes reaproveitam esta mesma chave.",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('idempotencyKey', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('devolve entryId e businessDate', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.entryId).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "    pm.expect(body.businessDate).to.match(/^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/);",
                  "    pm.expect(body.amountInCents).to.eql(12500);",
                  "    pm.expect(body.nature).to.eql('Credit');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('Recorded');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('correlationId da resposta = X-Correlation-Id enviado', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.correlationId).to.eql(pm.request.headers.get('X-Correlation-Id'));",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('entryId', body.entryId);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('businessDate', body.businessDate);",
                  "// Guarda o X-Correlation-Id deste registro: é o que aparece nos logs dos dois serviços.",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('entryCorrelationId', body.correlationId);",
                  "console.log('correlationId=' + body.correlationId + ' entryId=' + body.entryId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{idempotencyKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"amountInCents\": 12500, \"nature\": \"Credit\", \"description\": \"Venda do pedido 123\"}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{entryBaseUrl}}/api/v1/entries",
              "host": [
                "{{entryBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "entries"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Registra um crédito de R$ 125,00 com uma Idempotency-Key nova. Guarda entryId e businessDate para as próximas requisições."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Repetir mesma chave e payload (200, replay)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Depende de 'Registrar lançamento (201)': sem ele, a variável fica vazia e a API responderia 400 ou 404.",
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('idempotencyKey')) {",
                  "    throw new Error(\"Variável idempotencyKey vazia: envie primeiro 'Registrar lançamento (201)' com o ambiente 'cashflow local' selecionado, na mesma coleção.\");",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('cabeçalho Idempotency-Replayed: true', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Idempotency-Replayed')).to.eql('true');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('mesmo entryId do registro original', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().entryId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('entryId'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{idempotencyKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"amountInCents\": 12500, \"nature\": \"Credit\", \"description\": \"Venda do pedido 123\"}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{entryBaseUrl}}/api/v1/entries",
              "host": [
                "{{entryBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "entries"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Reenvia a mesma Idempotency-Key com o mesmo corpo: o serviço devolve o lançamento original, sem criar outro."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mesma chave, payload diferente (409)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Depende de 'Registrar lançamento (201)': sem ele, a variável fica vazia e a API responderia 400 ou 404.",
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('idempotencyKey')) {",
                  "    throw new Error(\"Variável idempotencyKey vazia: envie primeiro 'Registrar lançamento (201)' com o ambiente 'cashflow local' selecionado, na mesma coleção.\");",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('409 Conflict', () => pm.response.to.have.status(409));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('code = idempotency_payload_mismatch', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.code).to.eql('idempotency_payload_mismatch');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('details.entryId aponta para o lançamento original', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.details.entryId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('entryId'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{idempotencyKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"amountInCents\": 99999, \"nature\": \"Credit\", \"description\": \"Venda do pedido 123\"}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{entryBaseUrl}}/api/v1/entries",
              "host": [
                "{{entryBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "entries"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Reenvia a mesma Idempotency-Key com outro valor: o serviço recusa, porque a chave já pertence a outra operação."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sem Idempotency-Key (400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('400 Bad Request', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "pm.test('code = missing_idempotency_key', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql('missing_idempotency_key');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"amountInCents\": 12500, \"nature\": \"Credit\", \"description\": \"Venda do pedido 123\"}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{entryBaseUrl}}/api/v1/entries",
              "host": [
                "{{entryBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "entries"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Sem o cabeçalho Idempotency-Key, o registro é recusado."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar lançamento (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Depende de 'Registrar lançamento (201)': sem ele, a variável fica vazia e a API responderia 400 ou 404.",
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('entryId')) {",
                  "    throw new Error(\"Variável entryId vazia: envie primeiro 'Registrar lançamento (201)' com o ambiente 'cashflow local' selecionado, na mesma coleção.\");",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('entryId confere', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.entryId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('entryId'));",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('valor e natureza conferem', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.amountInCents).to.eql(12500);",
                  "    pm.expect(body.nature).to.eql('Credit');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{entryBaseUrl}}/api/v1/entries/{{entryId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{entryBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "entries",
                "{{entryId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Consulta o lançamento registrado no primeiro passo."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Consolidado",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Consolidado do dia (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Sem um registro anterior, consulta o dia de hoje no fuso de São Paulo.",
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('businessDate')) {",
                  "    let today;",
                  "    try {",
                  "        today = new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-CA', { timeZone: 'America/Sao_Paulo' });",
                  "    } catch (e) {",
                  "        today = new Date(Date.now() - 3 * 3600 * 1000).toISOString().slice(0, 10);",
                  "    }",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('businessDate', today);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "// A projeção é atualizada de forma assíncrona: o saldo não é verificado aqui.",
                  "pm.test('days é uma lista', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().days).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{consolidationBaseUrl}}/api/v1/consolidation?fromDate={{businessDate}}&toDate={{businessDate}}",
              "host": [
                "{{consolidationBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "consolidation"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "fromDate",
                  "value": "{{businessDate}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "toDate",
                  "value": "{{businessDate}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Saldo do dia do lançamento. O Consolidado recebe o lançamento por evento, de forma assíncrona: espere cerca de 2 s depois do POST para ver o valor somado."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
